1
00:00:00,742 --> 00:00:02,832
(Sheldon:)Leonard, please,
you know Amy moving in...

2
00:00:03,044 --> 00:00:05,944
(Sheldon:)...marks a level of intimacy
our relationship isn't ready for.

3
00:00:06,147 --> 00:00:10,517
(Penny:)Yes. That is a real thing. And it doesn't
mean you don't care about each other...

4
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:14,879
(Penny:)...it just means things are moving at a pace
you're not comfortable with. And that's fine.

5
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:18,180
If he doesn't wanna live with her,
he should tell her how he feels.

6
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:21,383
(Penny:)Maybe he doesn't know how to say it
without hurting her feelings.

7
00:00:21,596 --> 00:00:24,896
Feelings? Who am I,
a hippie at a love-in? No.

8
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:29,090
(Sheldon:)The problem is she laid out a series
of logical arguments that I couldn't refute.

9
00:00:29,337 --> 00:00:32,037
- That is the worst, isn't it?
- Yes.

10
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,210
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, Sheldon. I can't help you.

11
00:00:34,409 --> 00:00:37,739
Oh, spoiler alert:
This door's about to slam in your face.

12
00:00:39,247 --> 00:00:44,087
(Amy:)Oh, there you are.
When do I get a key to our apartment?

13
00:00:46,054 --> 00:01:01,024
(Leonard:)Um...

